    "Id": "chassisdef_ion_sparrow_IOS-C",
    "Name": "Ion Sparrow",
    "Details": "Apparently a replacement for the Fire Moth, this configuration carries three ER small lasers in each arm, all tied into a targeting computer.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
